  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboleesa kanke Harunifi ilmaani isaa Nadabu, Abihu, Eleazarifi Ithamari wolti yaami, gosa worra Israeli taanini gargari baasi, aka worri qaalole naa tahe huji qaalole hojatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woya qulqullo oboleesa kanke Haruni hod'i, ta mid'aagumafi guddinna kennituufi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeeyi ch'ufa ta anini qalbi kenneefi wolti yaami, ha woya Haruni suni mid'aasitu, aka isaa eebisani qaallu tolchani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woyaani worri mid'aasu male tana: ukha fulla qomati hod'ani, woya toko ta aka korrbo hid'atani, ubaara d'eera miila gahu, ubaara barreesani, sure, ammalle gurda. Miha kana ch'ufa worri ha oboleesa kanke Harunifi ilmaani isati mid'aasuti, aka worri qaalole tahe naa hojatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeeyiini tunini ha liilana worqitiifi liilana bule, bule diima, diima, ammalle woya booftatiini hojatuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle worri ha woya toko, ta aka korrbo hid'atani, liilana worqitiifi liilana bule, bule diima, diima ammalle woya boofta ta barreesanini mid'aasuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haada lama ka fulla gurmu lachu iraa bahu ha iti hod'aniti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurda mid'aaga toko, ka liilanuma kaaniini mid'aasani, woya aka korrbo suniini wolti hod'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'akha ch'ululuqa lama fuud'i, maqa ilmaani Israeli irati qori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma worri d'aloota wolti aanuni, jaa d'akha toko irati qori, jaalle kaani irati qori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma ogeesi d'akha qube beesisa irati qoru, akasuma maqa ilmaani Israeli ha qorani. D'akha lamaani suni ha worqiini marsaniti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'akha suni haada gurmu ira baasani kaani lamaani ka woya aka korrbo mid'aasani taaniti ha hod'ani, aka gosa kud'ani lamaani Israeli yo ch'ufa qaabatani. Akanaani Harunini hojja ch'ufa maqa worraa gurmu ufiiti baate, hojja ch'ufa AABBO Waaqileeni worra ufii qaabatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worqi d'akhaani Marsani lama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammalle looti lama ta worqi qulqullo, ta aka museensa fohani mid'aasi, worqi marsani suniti kayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ukha qoma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukha qoma qaallicha guddaa mid'aasi, aka inni suniini dubbi muru. Ukha kanale liilanuma woya aka korrbo mid'aasani taanini ha mid'aasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoti isaa ch'ufti ha haga takaa tahuti, ammalle ha wolti dachaasaniti. D'eerinnafi ballinnileeni ha taaku toko tahuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'akha ch'ululuqa ch'ororsi, dacha afuri irati hod'i. Dachaani qara ta d'akha diimatifi, barricha, ammalle diima d'iiga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ta lameeso d'akha dotifi, bule chulkicha aka dulo dooqaati, adi chulkicha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ta sadeeso d'akha bule had'icha, haama, ammalle bule diima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ta afreeso d'akha doti, diima, ammalle chulkicha. D'akhaye tana ch'ufa ha worqiini marsaniti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'akhaye kud'ani lama tana irati ha maqa ilmaani Israeli toko tokooni qoraniti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukha isaa ka qomati looti worqi qulqulliti, aka museensa fohani, mid'aasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qube worqi lama mid'aasi, ukha suni afaani isaa ka gubbaa qota lachuti hod'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museensa worqi kaani lamaani qube taani lamaaniti kayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museensa kaani lamaani, fiit'e isaa, worqi marsani taaniti kayi, aka akanaani haada gurmu ira bahu ka woya aka korrbo taanitiini hod'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni qube lama ta worqi mid'aasi, qube suni ukha kaani qota jalaa moga lamaaniti woya aka korrbo mid'aasani suni qota garaa keesa kayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qube worqi lama d'ibi mid'aasi, qube suni haada woya aka korrbo taani, fuula dura fulla qoma jalati, d'aatu fulla haada woya aka korrbo suniini wolti hod'ani, ta gurdaani oliiti hod'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qube ukhatiifi ta woya aka korrbo taani haada buleeni wolti hid'i, aka ukhi gurda gubba tau kaani inchochone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
